---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What this site collects about its visitors: cookieless analytics and nothing else.">
  <section class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-4 pt-10 pb-10 md:px-20 md:pt-18 md:pb-18">
    <div class="text-lg">
      <p class="text-dim">$ cat ~/privacy.md</p>
      <h1 class="font-semibold text-3xl">Privacy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose max-w-prose">
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to count visits and see which posts get read. It runs with analytics
        storage denied, so it sets no cookies and keeps no identifier on your device. Google receives the page
        URL, referrer, and coarse device and location data, and models the counts from that.
      </p>
      <p>No ads, no other trackers, no forms, no accounts.</p>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub logs requests, including IP addresses, under the
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub privacy statement</a>.
      </p>
      <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
